jetty - A tiny GTK terminal all in one file.

===========================================================

How to install.

    1. Run 'make'.
    2. Run 'make install' with elevated privileges.

How to configure.

    1. Open 'jetty.c' in a text editor.
    2. Edit the variables at the top of the file.
    3. Reinstall.

Launch via either '/usr/local/bin/jetty' if it is not in your path, or just 'jetty'.

